{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.poster.avif?t=1763987288\" width=600 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.webm?t=1763987288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.mp4?t=1763987288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcuffed to a bizarre arcade machine with a revolver locked to your skull, you're forced to play a deadly game where failure means death.\u00a0The machine's screen flickers to life, revealing Diemon, a menacing floating die with glowing eyes, who forces you to play\u00a0a deadly top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Insert dice into the arcade machine to load your weapons and fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeac Consume substances to gain short-lived boosts in the fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 A pounding hard raw techno soundtrack that pushes you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 A sentry gun revolver tracks your mistakes. Fail too often and it fires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this a dice game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. This is a top-down shooter born from a healthy hatred of dice, where you load them as bullets and shoot d-headed enemies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644830?t=1763987288","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644830?t=1763987288","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/6692423d94fc590cfa0cde21b1f1e9bacd8b17b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763987288","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/6692423d94fc590cfa0cde21b1f1e9bacd8b17b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763987288","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains pixel art violence with blood, brief death sequence (no gore), and alcohol/tobacco use."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.poster.avif?t=1763987288\" width=600 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.webm?t=1763987288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/extras/7898a3af90389d3296361ce14dd25320.mp4?t=1763987288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcuffed to a bizarre arcade machine with a revolver locked to your skull, you're forced to play a deadly game where failure means death.\u00a0The machine's screen flickers to life, revealing Diemon, a menacing floating die with glowing eyes, who forces you to play\u00a0a deadly top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Insert dice into the arcade machine to load your weapons and fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeac Consume substances to gain short-lived boosts in the fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 A pounding hard raw techno soundtrack that pushes you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 A sentry gun revolver tracks your mistakes. Fail too often and it fires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Is this a dice game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No. This is a top-down shooter born from a healthy hatred of dice, where you load them as bullets and shoot d-headed enemies.</p>","developers":["Roope Korpela"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644830/7e70c0957f3462805e34769f904b2a1f2300bd3b/header.jpg?t=1763987288","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Relatively modern dedicated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 